OL,3,ANot all AI workers think the tech could
OL,4,Akill everyone
OL,5,
OL,6,FNot all employees of major firms
OL,7,Fworking on artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,8,Fthink the technology spells doom for
OL,9,Fhumanity.
OL,11,FIn text exchanges and conversations,
OL,12,Fmultiple people who have worked for
OL,13,Fcompanies including OpenAI, Meta and
OL,14,FDeepMind were sceptical of the idea
OL,15,Fthat unchecked AI development would
OL,16,Flead to tools that could kill people en
OL,17,Fmasse.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
