OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AApple Music to open concert venue in
OL,4,ABattersea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US tech giant Apple is to open a
OL,7,Fnew, state-of-the-art concert hall in
OL,8,FLondon, situated underneath its UK
OL,9,Fheadquarters at Battersea Power
OL,10,FStation.
OL,12,FThe 600-capacity venue will host
OL,13,Fone-off shows by major recording
OL,14,Fartists and new bands, all of which
OL,15,Fwill be filmed and broadcast live
OL,16,Fonline.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790083454
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AApple Music to open concert venue in
OL,4,ABattersea
OL,5,
OL,6,FApple Music's vice president, Oliver
OL,7,FSchusser, told BBC News the facility,
OL,8,Fwhich is expected to open in the coming
OL,9,Fweeks, contained "more cameras and
OL,10,Fspeakers than any venue of its size,
OL,11,Fanywhere in the world".
OL,13,FIt comes as London's live music scene
OL,14,Ffaces huge pressure, with 45 venues
OL,15,Fclosing in the capital last year alone.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
